 "summary": "<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW253792608 BCX8\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW253792608 BCX8\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW253792608 BCX8\">On October 9, 2026, a large earthquake was registered, estimated between 7.2 and 7.7, with an epicenter reported in the area of Tonosí, province of Los Santos. The telluric movement was perceived in much of the national territory and has been followed by various aftershocks, generating structural damage, interruptions of services and preventive evacuations in multiple provinces.</span> <span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW253792608 BCX8\">Preliminary reports indicate significant damage to public and private infrastructure, damage to homes, interruptions of communications and basic services, as well as temporary displacement of people to safe places. Response teams and Local Committees continue to carry out rapid assessments to determine the full extent of the damage and emerging humanitarian needs.</span><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW253792608 BCX8\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}\"> </span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW253792608 BCX8\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW253792608 BCX8\"><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW253792608 BCX8\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\"> </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW253792608 BCX8\">Main reported effects</span><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW253792608 BCX8\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\"> </span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW253792608 BCX8\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW253792608 BCX8\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW253792608 BCX8\">Province of Coclé - Penonomé</span><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW253792608 BCX8\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\"> </span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW253792608 BCX8\">\r\n<ul class=\"BulletListStyle1 SCXW253792608 BCX8\" role=\"list\">\r\n<li class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW253792608 BCX8\" role=\"listitem\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"28\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW253792608 BCX8\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW253792608 BCX8\">Structural damage to Local Committee facilities.</span><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW253792608 BCX8\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\"> </span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW253792608 BCX8\">\r\n<ul class=\"BulletListStyle1 SCXW253792608 BCX8\" role=\"list\">\r\n<li class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW253792608 BCX8\" role=\"listitem\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"28\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW253792608 BCX8\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW253792608 BCX8\">Report of the collapse of the Dos Continente Hotel.</span><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW253792608 BCX8\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\"> </span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW253792608 BCX8\">\r\n<ul class=\"BulletListStyle1 SCXW253792608 BCX8\" role=\"list\">\r\n<li class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW253792608 BCX8\" role=\"listitem\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"28\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW253792608 BCX8\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW253792608 BCX8\">Effects on banks.</span><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW253792608 BCX8\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\"> </span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW253792608 BCX8\">\r\n<ul class=\"BulletListStyle1 SCXW253792608 BCX8\" role=\"list\">\r\n<li class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW253792608 BCX8\" role=\"listitem\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"28\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW253792608 BCX8\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW253792608 BCX8\" lang=\"ES-PA\" xml:lang=\"ES-PA\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW253792608 BCX8\">Damage to </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW253792608 BCX8\">road</span> infrastructure</span><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW253792608 BCX8\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\"> </span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW253792608 BCX8\">\r\n<ul class=\"BulletListStyle1 SCXW253792608 BCX8\" role=\"list\">\r\n<li class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW253792608 BCX8\" role=\"listitem\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"28\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW253792608 BCX8\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW253792608 BCX8\" lang=\"ES-PA\" xml:lang=\"ES-PA\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW253792608 BCX8\">Collapse of </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW253792608 BCX8\">residences </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW253792608 BCX8\">and </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW253792608 BCX8\">damage to</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW253792608 BCX8\"> buildings </span></span><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW253792608 BCX8\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\"> </span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW253792608 BCX8\">\r\n<ul class=\"BulletListStyle1 SCXW253792608 BCX8\" role=\"list\">\r\n<li class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW253792608 BCX8\" role=\"listitem\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"28\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW253792608 BCX8\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW253792608 BCX8\">People temporarily sheltered in the facilities of the Red Cross.</span><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW253792608 BCX8\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\"> </span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW253792608 BCX8\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW253792608 BCX8\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW253792608 BCX8\">Province of Los Santos</span><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW253792608 BCX8\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\"> </span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW253792608 BCX8\">\r\n<ul class=\"BulletListStyle1 SCXW253792608 BCX8\" role=\"list\">\r\n<li class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW253792608 BCX8\" role=\"listitem\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"29\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW253792608 BCX8\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW253792608 BCX8\">Structural damage to homes.</span><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW253792608 BCX8\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\"> </span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW253792608 BCX8\">\r\n<ul class=\"BulletListStyle1 SCXW253792608 BCX8\" role=\"list\">\r\n<li class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW253792608 BCX8\" role=\"listitem\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"29\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW253792608 BCX8\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW253792608 BCX8\">Collapse of heritage houses built in mud.</span><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW253792608 BCX8\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\"> </span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW253792608 BCX8\">\r\n<ul class=\"BulletListStyle1 SCXW253792608 BCX8\" role=\"list\">\r\n<li class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW253792608 BCX8\" role=\"listitem\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"29\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW253792608 BCX8\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW253792608 BCX8\">Damage reported in the Church of La Villa.</span><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW253792608 BCX8\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\"> </span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW253792608 BCX8\">\r\n<ul class=\"BulletListStyle1 SCXW253792608 BCX8\" role=\"list\">\r\n<li class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW253792608 BCX8\" role=\"listitem\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"29\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW253792608 BCX8\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW253792608 BCX8\">Presence of aftershocks that maintain the concern of the population</span><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW253792608 BCX8\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\"> </span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW253792608 BCX8\">\r\n<ul class=\"BulletListStyle1 SCXW253792608 BCX8\" role=\"list\">\r\n<li class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW253792608 BCX8\" role=\"listitem\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"29\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW253